---

<section
  class="booksy-alt__section booksy-alt-brand-journey"
  aria-labelledby="booksy-alt-brand-journey-title"
>
  <div class="booksy-alt__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__layout">
      <header class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__intro">
        <p class="booksy-alt__eyebrow">MARKETPLACE OR YOUR OWN BRAND?</p>
        <h2 id="booksy-alt-brand-journey-title" class="booksy-alt__h2">
          Where do you want the booking journey to live?
        </h2>
        <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__support">
          Two booking models. One key difference: where your customer experience lives.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__panel">
        <div class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__booksy">
          <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__label">BOOKSY</p>
          <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__note">
            Booksy includes marketplace discovery as part of its ecosystem.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__kersivo">
          <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__label booksy-alt-brand-journey__label--kersivo">
            KERSIVO
          </p>
          <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__lead">
            KERSIVO takes a different route: your own website, your own domain and a booking journey
            built around your barbershop.
          </p>
          <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__lead">
            If your clients already find you through Google, Instagram, referrals or your reputation,
            KERSIVO keeps the next step under your brand too.
          </p>
          <p class="booksy-alt-brand-journey__statement">
            Your clients find your barbershop. KERSIVO helps keep the booking journey there too.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
